# Android (Kotlin)

Stack: **Kotlin · Jetpack Compose · Hilt · Room · Media3 · OkHttp · Coroutines/Flow**.

Follow [Google app architecture](https://developer.android.com/topic/architecture): **UI → domain → data**, unidirectional data flow, single source of truth.

## Package layout (target)

```
com.tonezen.app/
  ui/           # Composables, ViewModels, UiState — one feature per subpackage
  domain/       # Pure Kotlin: models, rules, merge/sync logic — NO android.* imports
  data/
    local/      # Room entities, DAOs, DB, *Repository impl, EntityMappers
    remote/     # HTTP/Realtime clients — split by OpenAPI domain, not one ApiClient
    network/    # Connectivity and transport helpers
  playback/     # Media3 service + client bridge
  di/           # Hilt modules only
```

Repositories align with OpenAPI domains: `catalog`, `downloads`, `progress`, `auth` — same split as `backend/api` and desktop.

## Layer rules

| Layer | May import | Must NOT |
|-------|------------|----------|
| `ui/` | domain models, repository **interfaces** or injected repos | `CatalogDao`, `Room`, raw `OkHttp`, entity types |
| `domain/` | stdlib only | `android.*`, `androidx.*` (incl. Compose), Room, OkHttp, Supabase |
| `data/` | domain, Room, OkHttp, platform SDKs | Compose, ViewModels |
| `playback/` | domain, Media3 | Business rules (auto-advance → domain coordinator) |

**Mapping:** entity/DTO ↔ domain only in `data/` (`EntityMappers.kt` or per-domain mapper). Never in `domain/` or `ui/`.

## ViewModel

- **One ViewModel per feature** (`LibraryViewModel`, `PlayerViewModel`, `AuthViewModel`) — not a god `MainViewModel`.
- Expose **`StateFlow<FeatureUiState>`**; UI collects with `collectAsStateWithLifecycle()`.
- **Unidirectional data flow:** UI sends events (`onPlayClicked`) → ViewModel calls repository/use-case → updates `UiState`.
- ViewModel **orchestrates** only: no JSON parsing, no SQL, no merge/conflict rules.
- Inject **repositories**, not `CatalogDao` / `ApiClient`.
- Avoid `@ApplicationContext Context` in ViewModel — inject `NetworkMonitor` or pass `isOnline` from a repository.
- No `while (true)` polling loops — use `Flow` from repository, `callbackFlow`, or `PlaybackClient.snapshot`.
- Mutations in `viewModelScope`; never `GlobalScope`.

## Compose

- Screens are **stateless**: `Screen(uiState, onEvent)`.
- **Hoist state** to ViewModel; Composables only hold ephemeral UI state (text field focus).
- No business rules in `@Composable` (no `if (contentType == …)` for sync, no repository calls).
- User-visible strings **inline at usage sites** (**Russian only**) — use Kotlin templates for formatted copy (`"$count треков"`).
- Split files **&lt; ~200 lines**; extract sub-composables to `components/` or feature-local files.
- Theme/colors in `ui/theme/`; no magic hex in screens except one-off decor with comment.

## Data & Room

- **Separate files:** `BookEntity.kt`, `CatalogDao.kt`, `TonezenDatabase.kt` — not one mega-file.
- DAO methods return **entities**; repositories expose **domain types** or `Flow<List<Book>>`.
- All DB/network IO is **`suspend`** or **`Flow`** — never block main thread.
- Offline-first: **write local first**, sync when online (audiobooks only for progress).
- Do not inject `CatalogDao` outside `data/` — only repositories.

## Coroutines & Flow

- Repository returns `Flow` for observable data; `suspend` for one-shot commands.
- Use **`stateIn`** / **`shareIn`** in ViewModel when multiple collectors need the same stream.
- When tests are requested: `runTest`, Turbine for Flow; domain tests without Robolectric when possible.

## DI (Hilt)

- Constructor `@Inject` on repositories and ViewModels.
- `@Singleton` for repos and clients; no manual `SessionManager()` defaults in repositories.
- Bind repository interfaces in `di/` when faking for tests.

## Playback

- `MediaSessionService` for background audio; UI talks via `PlaybackClient`.
- Domain playback rules (`PlaybackCoordinator`, `CyclePlaybackResolver`) live in `domain/playback/` and must be **wired** — no dead unused code.

## Auth & sync (Tonezen)

- Expired JWT offline ≠ logout; refresh **only when online**.
- Audiobook progress: local write always, push when online; music progress **local only**.
- LWW merge in `domain/progress/`; transport in `data/remote/progress/`.

## Forbidden

- God ViewModel / god `ApiClient` / god DAO file
- `domain/` importing Room entities or Android SDK
- ViewModel → `CatalogDao` or entity types
- English user-facing copy in clients
- Synchronous network/DB on main thread
- Server sync of music progress
- Force logout on expired JWT when offline

## Verify

Only when the user explicitly asks for verification:

```bash
cd apps/android && ./gradlew assembleDebug
rg "import android\.|import androidx\.|CatalogDao|BookEntity" apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/tonezen/app/domain/
rg "CatalogDao" apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/tonezen/app/ui/
rg "DownloadQueueDao|CatalogDao" apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/tonezen/app/playback/
```

Android has no unit-test suite (aligned with desktop).